<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A8" title="In Generalization in Online Reinforcement Learning for Mobile Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">H </span>Agent Design</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A8.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In Appendix H Agent Design ‣ Generalization in Online Reinforcement Learning for Mobile Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Action space.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A8.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In Appendix H Agent Design ‣ Generalization in Online Reinforcement Learning for Mobile Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Prompt Template.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
